# Files uploaded to Vercel for the deployed backend (V17). An allowlist: the
# first rule ignores everything at the top level, the "!" rules bring back
# only what the FastAPI function needs at run time.
#
# Kept out: data/ (local catalogs, indexes, evaluation outputs: several GB;
# the deployed catalog lives in Neon), tests/, docs/, review/, scripts/
# (loaders run from this machine), requirements.txt (the full local
# environment; the function installs the pins of pyproject.toml), .env and
# every other local file (tooling, caches, editor settings, node_modules).
/*
!/app
!/pyproject.toml
!/vercel.json

# Inside app/: the evaluation package (code and relevance judgments) only
# serves POST /evaluate, which the deployment switches off.
/app/evaluation
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.DS_Store
